### Register user 1
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "FullName": "John Doe",
    "Email": "johndoe@email.com",
    "Password": "JohnPassword"
}

### Login user 1
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Email": "johndoe@email.com",
    "Password": "JohnPassword"
}

### Create Post 1 with Logged User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tsIIvlQV7wKtoNdyIXWipaqGCl1Cgb1fd6mkfL8i1xw
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Title": "Blog ASP.NET Core",
    "Content": "Esse blog está sendo construído utilizando asp.net core, entity framework, identity framework e JWT."
}

### Create Post 2 with Logged User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tsIIvlQV7wKtoNdyIXWipaqGCl1Cgb1fd6mkfL8i1xw
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Title": "Meu Segundo Post",
