}

### List all posts of all users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tsIIvlQV7wKtoNdyIXWipaqGCl1Cgb1fd6mkfL8i1xw

### List one post by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tsIIvlQV7wKtoNdyIXWipaqGCl1Cgb1fd6mkfL8i1xw
